  "result": "Perfect! All 130 tests pass. I've added voucher support:\n\n**applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })** \u2014 Applies a fixed discount voucher:\n- **When:** Only on draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT error if not draft)\n- **One per invoice:** Returns VOUCHER_EXISTS if invoice already has a voucher\n- **Validation:** Amount must be a positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n- **Returns:** ok(newInvoice) with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- **Never mutates** the original invoice\n\n**Updated invoiceTotals** now includes voucher:\n- Returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- **Formula:** `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n- Voucher is applied AFTER VAT (final discount)\n\n**Example workflow:**\n```javascript\n// Create invoice\nconst invoice = createInvoice({...}).value;\n// invoice total = \u20ac102.30\n\n// Apply voucher for \u20ac10.00 off\nconst r = applyVoucher(invoice, { code: 'SUMMER2026', amount: 1000 });\n// r.value.voucher = { code: 'SUMMER2026', amount: 1000 }\n\n// Updated totals\ninvoiceTotals(r.value)\n// Returns: { subtotal: ..., discount: ..., vat: ..., voucher: 1000, total: 9230 }\n// (\u20ac92.30 instead of \u20ac102.30)\n```\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- Voucher amount is in cents (like all money in this system)\n- Applied to final total (after line discounts and VAT)\n- One voucher per invoice maximum\n- Only editable before invoice is issued\n\n**Tests** (7 new) verify:\n- Voucher application to draft invoices\n- Correct total calculation with voucher\n- Rejection on non-draft, multi-voucher, invalid amount\n- Non-mutation guarantee\n- Proper preservation in invoiceTotals",
